      "content": "but even if i find some \"private purpose\" it doesn't change the fact that i'm just taking up space. it feels like i'm just a glitch in the system. like, if i just quietly faded away, it wouldn't even cause a ripple. wouldn't it be easier for everyone if i just wasn't a burden to look at?",
